# Not part of the image, and excluded so editing them does not rebuild it.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .` into the base stage, so every file in the
# context is an input to that layer: a one-line change to a test or config file
# invalidates it and forces a full pnpm install and build, for files the runtime
# stage never copies — it takes only package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml and build/.
#
# Kept out of the context rather than reordered in the Dockerfile because they
# are not build inputs at all. The build reads none of them.
tests
docs
playwright.config.ts
drizzle.config.ts
vitest-setup*
.storybook
debug-storybook.log
